# Ingestion

## Where rules live (do not re-derive here)

- Write model (payload merge + `WRITE_TRUNCATE`), endpoint map, completeness semantics: [docs/data_contract.md](../../docs/data_contract.md).
- Operational procedures (env vars, ingest lock, IAM for BigQuery Storage Read API, known endpoint quirks): [docs/operations_guide.md](../../docs/operations_guide.md).

## Naming

- Timestamp columns end with `_at`.
- Merge helpers in `payload_merge.py` are named `merge_<entity>_<shape>` (e.g. `merge_fixtures_envelope`, `merge_standings_envelope`).
